---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Phone from '../components/Phone.astro';

const download = 'https://github.com/aipdv/better-files/releases/latest';
---
<Base
  title="Better Files: search your phone by meaning"
  description="Better Files is a free, open source file manager for Android. It searches your documents and photos by meaning, on your phone. No cloud, no account."
>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-reveal="hero"><i></i>Open source · Android · Free beta</div>
    <h1 data-reveal="hero">Search your phone <em>by meaning.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead" data-reveal="hero">Better Files searches your documents and photos by meaning. On your phone. No cloud, no account.</p>
    <div class="cta" data-reveal="hero">
      <a class="btn p" href={download}>Download APK</a>
      <a class="btn v" href="#video"><b></b>Watch the video <small>2:23</small></a>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stage" data-stage>
      <div class="chip c1" data-reveal="chip"><b>By meaning</b><span>not by file name</span></div>
      <div class="chip c2" data-reveal="chip"><b>Files stay on the phone</b><span>search runs on the phone</span></div>
      <div class="chip c3" data-reveal="chip"><b>Docs and photos</b><span>PDF, Word, text, JPG, PNG</span></div>
      <Phone />
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="statement" data-reveal="words">You remember what's in a file. <span>Not what you named it.</span></p>

    <div class="steps">
      <div data-reveal="up"><em>i.</em><p style="margin:0"><b>Install and accept the model.</b><span>One download of about 320 MB. Photo search needs 110 MB more.</span></p></div>
      <div data-reveal="up"><em>ii.</em><p style="margin:0"><b>It reads your files on the phone.</b><span>Newest files first. On older phones, the first index takes hours.</span></p></div>
      <div data-reveal="up"><em>iii.</em><p style="margin:0"><b>Search in your own words.</b><span>"land records", "beach at sunset". In English, Hindi or Hinglish.</span></p></div>
    </div>

    <section class="sec" id="features">
      <h2>What it does</h2>
      <p class="sub">A full file manager, with a search that understands what is inside your files.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up"><h3>Search by meaning</h3><p>Type "rent agreement" or "beach at sunset". It finds the file even when the name says nothing like that.</p></div>
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up"><h3>Stays on your phone</h3><p>The search model and the index live on the device. Your files, names and searches never leave it.</p></div>
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up"><h3>A full file manager</h3><p>Archives, root access, SMB, SFTP, FTP and WebDAV, themes. Built on Material Files.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec vid" id="video">
      <h2>See it work</h2>
      <p class="sub">A real search on a six-year-old phone. 2:23.</p>
      <div class="video">
        <video controls muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/video-poster.jpg">
          <source src="/better-files-launch.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <div class="vctl">
          <button class="vbtn pp" type="button" aria-label="Pause" hidden>
            <svg class="i-pause" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="2" width="3.5" height="12" rx="1" fill="currentColor" /><rect x="9.5" y="2" width="3.5" height="12" rx="1" fill="currentColor" /></svg>
            <svg class="i-play" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 2.5v11l9.5-5.5z" fill="currentColor" /></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="vbtn fs" type="button" aria-label="Full screen">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6V2h4M10 2h4v4M14 10v4h-4M6 14H2v-4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="sound" type="button">Tap for sound</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="privacy">
      <h2>Private by design</h2>
      <p class="sub">There is no account and no server of ours to send your files to.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up"><h3>Nothing leaves</h3><p>Your files, file names, folders and searches never leave your phone.</p></div>
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up"><h3>Analytics are off</h3><p>They stay off until you turn them on. If you do, only anonymous usage counts go to PostHog in the EU.</p></div>
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up"><h3>No tracking</h3><p>No ads, no advertising ID, no Google Play Services. Read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="limits">
      <h2>Before you install</h2>
      <p class="sub">This is a beta. Here is what to expect.</p>
      <div class="two">
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up">
          <h3>Requirements</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Android 10 or newer.</li>
            <li>The search model downloads once: about 320 MB. Photo search needs 110 MB more.</li>
            <li>Meaning search and photo search need about 3.5 GB of RAM. Phones with less search inside documents by keyword.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card" data-reveal="up">
          <h3>Known limits</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>The first index takes hours on older phones. You can search files as soon as they are done.</li>
            <li>Some phones stop apps in the background. If indexing stops, open Better Files. It continues where it stopped.</li>
            <li>Scanned PDFs and password-protected PDFs are not searchable yet.</li>
            <li>Excel, PowerPoint and old .doc files are not indexed yet.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="end">
      <h2>Find it by what it says.</h2>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn p" href={download}>Download APK</a>
        <a class="btn v" href="https://github.com/aipdv/better-files">Source on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<script>
  import '../scripts/motion.ts';
</script>
